                                                "sense_id": "d39b91d5-e36f-3b12-88cb-4190acc7635b",
                                                "text": "For time is a fleeting thing, and which appeareth as in a shadow, with the matter ever gliding, alwaies fluent, without ever being stable or permanent[…]."
